WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:43.250
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:43.520 --> 01:44.520
You wanted the Bangladesh

3
01:44.600 --> 01:45.920
petrochemical industry analysis report, right?

4
01:46.000 --> 01:47.600
I'll send it over in a bit.

5
01:48.640 --> 01:49.600
Xiaoyezi.

6
01:50.480 --> 01:51.520
Xiaoyezi!

7
01:51.600 --> 01:52.760
Here!

8
01:52.840 --> 01:56.840
I just… For a second there, I felt like I'd traveled back in time.

9
01:57.440 --> 01:59.680
Back when I was the study committee member calling roll, you'd always say, "Here!"

10
01:59.760 --> 02:01.280
Really loud.

11
02:01.800 --> 02:03.000
Really?

12
02:03.600 --> 02:04.840
What's wrong?

13
02:05.360 --> 02:07.000
You sound all muffled tonight.

14
02:07.640 --> 02:08.680
Tell me about it.

15
02:08.759 --> 02:11.000
I can't have you calling me Ikkyu-san all this time for nothing.

16
02:11.640 --> 02:12.560
Nothing much.

17
02:13.480 --> 02:16.280
Maybe I'm just tired lately. Got distracted.

18
02:17.240 --> 02:18.400
I heard it.

19
02:18.480 --> 02:21.160
You've been fidgeting with your periodic table, haven't you?

20
02:24.040 --> 02:25.680
Ever since your father passed,

21
02:25.760 --> 02:28.840
you started collecting the elements on the periodic table.

22
02:29.720 --> 02:31.120
You said you lost your dad,

23
02:31.760 --> 02:34.000
and at least collecting them all

24
02:34.080 --> 02:35.560
would make you feel like you owned the world.

25
02:36.200 --> 02:39.760
So you only fidget with your treasures when you're upset,

26
02:39.840 --> 02:41.920
clinking and clanking them around like just now.

27
02:42.520 --> 02:44.240
Come on. What happened?

28
02:45.440 --> 02:46.520
Nothing.

29
02:51.760 --> 02:53.000
I've fallen for someone.

30
03:05.760 --> 03:06.600
But?

31
03:08.320 --> 03:11.080
But it was over before it even started.

32
03:12.280 --> 03:13.120
It's okay.

33
03:13.920 --> 03:15.040
I've really come to terms with it.

34
03:17.280 --> 03:21.120
Like looking through the giant eye of a deep-sea blue hole,

35
03:22.840 --> 03:26.160
all the beauty is just an illusion.

36
03:29.280 --> 03:30.960
What does he mean by that?

37
03:36.680 --> 03:38.440
Do you think he's actually working right now?

38
03:39.640 --> 03:42.440
Or like me, unable to focus on anything?

39
03:53.720 --> 03:55.200
I have to do something.

40
04:07.360 --> 04:08.720
Got home safe?

41
04:12.560 --> 04:13.400
Yeah.

42
04:13.480 --> 04:16.320
XU CHI

43
04:16.399 --> 04:17.519
Working?

44
04:21.480 --> 04:23.720
No. Just staring into space.

45
04:35.880 --> 04:37.680
YANG RUI

46
04:42.400 --> 04:43.560
ANSWER

47
04:46.720 --> 04:47.560
Hello?

48
04:49.400 --> 04:50.680
Are you asleep?

49
04:51.720 --> 04:52.760
Not yet.

50
04:53.480 --> 04:54.440
What's up?

51
04:56.880 --> 04:58.200
I have something to tell you.

52
05:01.440 --> 05:02.480
Xu Chi.

53
05:04.800 --> 05:05.840
I like you.

54
05:07.000 --> 05:07.880
I know you take time to warm up to people.

55
05:08.680 --> 05:12.240
So I held back. I didn't want to pressure you.

56
05:12.320 --> 05:14.360
But when you pulled your hand away just now,

57
05:14.440 --> 05:15.640
it really hurt.

58
05:19.720 --> 05:20.840
I…

59
05:20.920 --> 05:23.440
Tell me… Was I… Was I not good enough?

60
05:24.040 --> 05:28.800
So, is there nothing about me that attracts you?

61
05:28.880 --> 05:31.120
That's not it. You're great.

62
05:32.400 --> 05:33.520
Then can we give it a try?

63
05:33.600 --> 05:34.920
Just a try.

64
05:35.560 --> 05:37.800
You can call it off anytime.

65
05:38.360 --> 05:39.200
Alright?

66
05:41.040 --> 05:42.120
Please say something.

67
05:48.880 --> 05:50.240
-Okay. -Really?

68
05:50.320 --> 05:51.520
Really.

69
05:51.600 --> 05:53.200
Then tomorrow, when I hold your hand, you can't pull away.

70
05:54.720 --> 05:59.240
Uh, let's talk about tomorrow when it comes.

71
05:59.760 --> 06:02.160
I… I'm a bit confused right now.

72
06:02.840 --> 06:03.720
Good night.

73
06:05.600 --> 06:06.800
YE THE LEGEND SENT AN IMAGE

74
06:14.440 --> 06:15.280
UNLOCK THE SECRETS OF EXECUTION

75
06:16.800 --> 06:19.000
This should help with the implementation phase of your proposal.

76
06:19.080 --> 06:20.280
Already emailed it to you.

77
06:20.960 --> 06:23.000
You need to organize the documents this week.

78
06:23.080 --> 06:25.040
Make sure to confirm the timelines.

79
06:28.400 --> 06:31.640
See? He's totally fine.

80
06:32.200 --> 06:34.040
Stop overthinking, will you?

81
06:39.160 --> 06:40.720
This is well noted.

82
06:43.920 --> 06:45.600
We have no shared interests or common ground!

83
06:45.680 --> 06:47.040
So let's break up, okay?

84
06:47.120 --> 06:49.320
Did you actually like me when we got together?

85
06:49.400 --> 06:51.040
Am I just a replacement for someone else?

86
06:52.360 --> 06:53.520
Say it!

87
06:53.600 --> 06:55.600
Explain it to me! Say it!

88
07:40.200 --> 07:42.960
I just got the official notice from Celestial Insurance.

89
07:43.040 --> 07:44.760
They've adopted our Plan B!

90
07:59.240 --> 08:00.720
Maxmise's signature celebration.

91
08:00.800 --> 08:02.680
Only happens for big wins.

92
08:03.880 --> 08:06.960
Xu Chi. You deserve the most credit for this one.

93
08:22.040 --> 08:22.880
Thank you, everyone.

94
08:22.960 --> 08:26.480
I… I just threw out a rough idea to spark conversation.

95
08:26.560 --> 08:28.200
I'm still new at this, so I have a lot to learn

96
08:28.280 --> 08:29.240
from all of you

97
08:29.320 --> 08:31.520
when it comes to refining the draft going forward.

98
08:31.600 --> 08:33.120
No excessive modesty allowed.

99
08:33.200 --> 08:34.960
You're an SBA now.

100
08:35.039 --> 08:36.400
No pretending to be a rookie.

101
08:49.240 --> 08:51.000
-Ms. Xu! -What a coincidence.

102
08:51.080 --> 08:52.640
Heading to Celestial?

103
08:52.720 --> 08:54.600
You and your boyfriend just got together. Why isn't he driving you?

104
08:55.320 --> 08:58.000
He's going to HQ. I'm going to the branch. We're not going the same way.

105
08:59.520 --> 09:00.560
I actually have a project over that way.

106
09:00.640 --> 09:02.560
-I'll give you a ride. -That'd be great.

107
09:08.160 --> 09:11.760
So you admit Yang Rui is your boyfriend?

108
09:14.320 --> 09:16.880
If you want to ask about Tianna, just say it.

109
09:16.960 --> 09:18.760
Stop beating around the bush.

110
09:19.280 --> 09:20.360
Alright. Got it.

111
09:20.440 --> 09:23.000
So with you, I can't be subtle. I have to be direct, right?

112
09:23.760 --> 09:27.280
I saw her staring at her desk for a long time

113
09:27.360 --> 09:29.080
after the meeting, before she started working.

114
09:29.680 --> 09:31.480
Did she get chewed out during the meeting?

115
09:32.000 --> 09:33.040
No way.

116
09:33.640 --> 09:35.360
Ma Ke is too smooth for that.

117
09:35.880 --> 09:37.920
Whether he messed me over or I messed him over,

118
09:38.000 --> 09:40.200
he acts like nothing ever happened.

119
09:40.280 --> 09:42.120
The client didn't pick Tianna's proposal.

120
09:42.200 --> 09:43.280
Ma Ke gave her comfort and encouragement.

121
09:43.880 --> 09:44.720
He just assigned her

122
09:44.800 --> 09:47.200
the same amount of work that he gave me at the meeting.

123
09:47.280 --> 09:49.680
He made sure to show his expectations and regard for her.

124
09:52.040 --> 09:53.360
That's good.

125
09:54.040 --> 09:55.280
I'm relieved.

126
09:57.160 --> 10:00.000
So the rumor was true then.

127
10:00.080 --> 10:01.520
Ma Ke did steal your proposal.

128
10:02.280 --> 10:04.120
Then what are you going to do?

129
10:04.200 --> 10:05.040
Just take it

130
10:05.120 --> 10:08.040
and finish this project under him, all nice and polite?

131
10:09.000 --> 10:09.840
What else can I do?

132
10:11.320 --> 10:13.840
You can't go through life without taking a few hits.

133
10:15.080 --> 10:19.800
I got bitten, so I showed a little fang to make sure he doesn't try it again.

134
10:19.880 --> 10:21.680
That's mission accomplished.

135
10:25.400 --> 10:26.520
What?

136
10:27.120 --> 10:28.600
Something's off.

137
10:29.360 --> 10:30.520
You're off.

138
10:30.600 --> 10:33.600
Look. If you have someone you like and you won a project,

139
10:33.680 --> 10:35.320
you should be happy.

140
10:35.400 --> 10:36.800
You don't seem excited at all.

141
10:38.160 --> 10:40.520
I am excited. Super excited.

142
10:40.600 --> 10:42.880
Stop pretending to be a shrink.

143
10:42.960 --> 10:45.160
Oh, come on. That's your idea of excited?

144
10:45.240 --> 10:47.240
And I haven't even gotten to the shrink part yet.

145
10:47.320 --> 10:51.120
See, when I'm pursuing Tianna, I'm always on edge,

146
10:51.200 --> 10:52.160
worrying about her every second.

147
10:52.240 --> 10:54.680
Even the tiny, trivial stuff matters to me.

148
10:54.760 --> 10:55.800
But you?

149
10:55.880 --> 10:58.000
You're totally calm when Yang Rui's brought up.

150
10:58.600 --> 11:01.120
And I'm close with him, but you never ask me anything.

151
11:01.200 --> 11:03.600
You don't ask about his likes or habits.

152
11:04.200 --> 11:08.560
So, there is always only one truth.

153
11:09.280 --> 11:10.520
You don't like him that much.

154
11:12.640 --> 11:14.320
Stop playing detective.

155
11:14.880 --> 11:17.280
We agreed. We're just giving it a shot.

156
11:17.360 --> 11:19.360
Maybe we'll grow on each other.

157
11:20.160 --> 11:22.840
Love is a spark, not something you force until it fits.

158
11:22.920 --> 11:26.960
Alright, alright. Detective Zhaonan, since you're so clear-headed,

159
11:27.480 --> 11:29.520
why are you still barking up the wrong tree with Tina?

160
11:30.720 --> 11:31.720
What are you talking about?

161
11:31.800 --> 11:35.000
She's not a wrong tree. She's a prized orchid!

162
11:35.080 --> 11:36.760
Say that again. I'll record it and send it to her.

163
11:36.840 --> 11:37.920
Sorry. I'm sorry.

164
11:39.360 --> 11:42.320
Even if you defend her behind her back, she won't be moved when she hears it.

165
11:42.400 --> 11:44.440
It's fine. As long as you're moved.

166
11:44.520 --> 11:47.440
Then you can just step up and become the official one.

167
11:47.520 --> 11:48.360
What?

168
11:48.440 --> 11:51.560
How did I never realize we have such great chemistry?

169
11:51.640 --> 11:54.560
Look. We come from the same background.

170
11:54.640 --> 11:56.120
We have the same goals.

171
11:56.200 --> 11:57.720
We're both good-looking and capable.

172
11:57.800 --> 11:59.320
I have a car, and you're buying an apartment.

173
11:59.400 --> 12:00.800
-Stop. I get it. -In the future, we'll…

174
12:00.880 --> 12:02.680
You're like a werewolf.

175
12:02.760 --> 12:04.840
And Bu Tianna is your full moon.

176
12:04.920 --> 12:05.800
The moment she's mentioned,

177
12:05.880 --> 12:07.240
you start transforming and talking nonsense.

178
12:11.760 --> 12:12.640
I'm speechless.

179
12:29.240 --> 12:30.320
PRIVATE, DO NOT ENTER

180
12:33.720 --> 12:34.840
Who's there?

181
12:35.440 --> 12:36.600
Miss.

182
12:41.720 --> 12:42.960
Scared me.

183
12:47.440 --> 12:48.520
What's wrong?

184
12:49.040 --> 12:49.920
What happened?

185
12:50.000 --> 12:52.080
Xiaojie's toy is in Miss Bu's room.

186
12:52.160 --> 12:53.000
He's fussing for it.

187
12:53.080 --> 12:54.640
I knocked.

188
12:54.720 --> 12:56.360
I thought no one was in the room, so I came in.

189
12:57.080 --> 12:58.840
Let me say this again.

190
12:58.920 --> 13:01.720
Even if I'm not here, you're not allowed in my room without my permission.

191
13:03.320 --> 13:04.360
Alright, alright.

192
13:04.440 --> 13:05.960
It was a misunderstanding. Go on.

193
13:06.040 --> 13:07.000
Xiaojie's waiting.

194
13:10.800 --> 13:11.640
Mom.

195
13:13.240 --> 13:14.160
We have so many rooms.

196
13:14.240 --> 13:15.920
Why do you have to keep his toys in my room?

197
13:16.840 --> 13:18.200
You're hardly ever home.

198
13:18.280 --> 13:19.320
This room gets great sunlight.

199
13:19.400 --> 13:22.080
Sometimes, I have Xiaojie play in here.

200
13:22.160 --> 13:25.280
He gets some sun without getting dirty in the yard.

201
13:26.120 --> 13:27.720
So after I get married,

202
13:27.800 --> 13:30.000
I won't even have the right to live in this house anymore?

203
13:30.080 --> 13:32.000
You're overthinking again.

204
13:32.080 --> 13:34.280
We're family. What's wrong with using your room?

205
13:35.840 --> 13:39.400
When you were little, you'd go into your dad's room

206
13:39.480 --> 13:41.680
and take over his desk to do homework.

207
13:41.760 --> 13:42.600
Don't you remember?

208
13:44.440 --> 13:45.680
We never got mad.

209
13:46.880 --> 13:50.600
Nana, you just think too much.

210
13:50.680 --> 13:54.600
I had Xiaojie so you'd have another family member,

211
13:54.680 --> 13:56.320
not another enemy.

212
14:01.280 --> 14:04.200
Oh, your dad checked out a villa in Sanya a while back.

213
14:04.280 --> 14:07.760
He said there's a round room facing the ocean.

214
14:07.840 --> 14:09.560
You'd love it.

215
14:09.640 --> 14:12.760
It's for you and your future husband.

216
14:15.920 --> 14:16.800
Okay.

217
14:16.880 --> 14:18.680
I get it, Mom.

218
14:38.120 --> 14:39.280
Why are you back so late?

219
14:39.360 --> 14:40.880
Do you want something to eat?

220
14:57.320 --> 14:59.680
Did you tell Tianna what I told you to say?

221
14:59.760 --> 15:02.520
Yeah. It actually worked.

222
15:02.600 --> 15:05.480
I'll drop another hint tomorrow at breakfast.

223
15:05.560 --> 15:08.520
I'll tell her I spent half the night rubbing your back.

224
15:08.600 --> 15:10.560
She'll feel bad for you when she hears that.

225
15:10.640 --> 15:11.960
If I keep saying it,

226
15:12.040 --> 15:14.600
she'll surely want to come home more often.

227
15:15.360 --> 15:17.840
But we have to take it step by step.

228
15:17.920 --> 15:21.640
We can't let Tianna stay so hostile toward Xiaojie.

229
15:21.720 --> 15:23.160
Then bring it up with her more often?

230
15:23.240 --> 15:27.840
Tell her how many favors you called in to help her with that insurance project.

231
15:27.920 --> 15:29.880
She's still too naive.

232
15:29.960 --> 15:31.760
Does she really think that bringing a few gifts

233
15:31.840 --> 15:33.160
and being polite

234
15:33.240 --> 15:37.600
would make people hand over such important internal research data?

235
15:37.680 --> 15:39.080
That was all because of my connections.

236
15:39.160 --> 15:42.440
Wait, if you helped her out, why did you go out of your way

237
15:42.520 --> 15:44.200
to have someone tell Mr. Zheng at Celestial

238
15:44.280 --> 15:46.440
to reject her proposal?

239
15:47.640 --> 15:50.000
She went into consulting without my permission.

240
15:50.080 --> 15:54.320
Back when she landed the Ande Energy deal, she was so full of herself.

241
15:55.640 --> 15:58.840
If I didn't knock her down a peg this time,

242
15:58.920 --> 16:00.760
she'd think she's invincible.

243
16:01.480 --> 16:07.120
Give her a few setbacks at work, then shower her with warmth at home.

244
16:07.200 --> 16:08.880
With a bit of push and pull like this,

245
16:08.960 --> 16:12.360
it won't be long before she feels burned out at Maxmise.

246
16:12.440 --> 16:16.800
Then, getting her back to our company will just fall into place.

247
16:16.880 --> 16:21.040
How can you use business tactics against your own daughter?

248
16:22.400 --> 16:24.280
That's not fair to say.

249
16:24.360 --> 16:25.920
I'm doing this for her own good.

250
16:26.000 --> 16:27.440
But what about Tianna?

251
16:27.520 --> 16:30.160
She's always so rebellious, always pushing back against me.

252
16:30.240 --> 16:31.960
Don't keep calling her Tianna.

253
16:32.040 --> 16:34.440
It's Nana. It's Nana.

254
16:48.200 --> 16:49.360
Ms. Zhu, look.

255
16:49.440 --> 16:52.080
I've already divided this project into four modules.

256
16:52.720 --> 16:54.680
You take these four modules and…

257
16:55.800 --> 16:57.040
-Hold on. -Do you need a break?

258
16:57.120 --> 16:58.120
I'm fine.

259
17:01.560 --> 17:04.520
Morning. I brought you some rice balls.

260
17:05.040 --> 17:06.480
Breakfast made with love?

261
17:08.200 --> 17:10.319
Ma Ke said Celestial is having a company-wide team-building this weekend.

262
17:10.400 --> 17:12.079
So our team gets a half day off.

263
17:12.160 --> 17:13.640
Want to think about where we should go this weekend?

264
17:15.839 --> 17:17.760
Some girl from the consulting firm just passed out!

265
17:18.400 --> 17:19.240
Tianna.

266
17:19.319 --> 17:21.520
Wake up. Are you okay?

267
17:21.599 --> 17:23.560
-Wake up -Should we call an ambulance?

268
17:23.640 --> 17:24.480
-Let me help you up. -Excuse me. Let me through.

269
17:24.560 --> 17:25.839
I'm from Maxmise. Thanks.

270
17:25.920 --> 17:27.839
Tianna! What happened?

271
17:27.920 --> 17:29.680
-Help her sit up. -Are you alright?

272
17:30.280 --> 17:31.160
Easy, easy.

273
17:31.680 --> 17:32.600
What happened?

274
17:33.440 --> 17:34.920
Come on, sit down.

275
17:35.000 --> 17:35.920
Nothing serious.

276
17:36.000 --> 17:37.600
-Probably low blood sugar. -Careful.

277
17:37.680 --> 17:39.400
Do you have any white chocolate

278
17:39.480 --> 17:40.480
-or sugary drinks here? -I have juice.

279
17:40.560 --> 17:41.400
Okay.

280
17:45.040 --> 17:46.160
Here, have some.

281
17:46.240 --> 17:47.920
How do you always manage to pass out right when I happen

282
17:48.000 --> 17:48.840
to have juice?

283
17:49.680 --> 17:51.040
The Actuarial Department is brutal.

284
17:51.120 --> 17:53.000
Two whole days, and you wouldn't let her leave the conference room.

285
17:53.080 --> 17:55.240
Even if she needed to verify the data, she didn't have to push herself that hard.

286
17:55.320 --> 17:57.240
Hey, that's not on us.

287
17:57.320 --> 17:59.160
We told her so many times.

288
17:59.240 --> 18:00.120
She refused to leave.

289
18:00.200 --> 18:01.160
We brought food in and she didn't touch it.

290
18:01.240 --> 18:02.640
Have some more.

291
18:03.160 --> 18:04.680
-Keep some chocolate -Excuse me.

292
18:04.760 --> 18:06.040
-in your bag from now on. -Excuse me.

293
18:08.360 --> 18:09.560
Sorry, everyone. Break it up.

294
18:09.640 --> 18:10.800
Don't crowd around, alright?

295
18:10.880 --> 18:11.960
-Thank you all. -Feeling any better?

296
18:13.640 --> 18:14.880
-Thanks. -Thanks. Leave this to me.

297
18:14.960 --> 18:17.720
Maybe you should take her to the hospital?

298
18:17.800 --> 18:18.840
Okay. Let me check.

299
18:20.560 --> 18:22.680
Tianna, are you alright? Want to go to the hospital?

300
18:23.280 --> 18:25.640
No need. I… I can still work.

301
18:25.720 --> 18:27.040
-Don't move. -No, no…

302
18:27.120 --> 18:28.040
Don't worry about work.

303
18:28.120 --> 18:29.920
Just go home and rest.

304
18:30.560 --> 18:32.840
Xu Chi, you're a girl. It's better if you take her home.

305
18:32.920 --> 18:34.960
-Go ahead and take her back. -I'll take her.

306
18:35.760 --> 18:37.400
Have the chocolate first.

307
18:54.920 --> 18:56.080
Let me get your bag.

308
18:56.160 --> 18:57.680
No, no need.

309
18:58.280 --> 18:59.800
Easy now.

310
18:59.880 --> 19:01.800
There's no one else here. No need to put on a brave face with me.

311
19:01.880 --> 19:03.560
You were breaking out in a cold sweat in the car.

312
19:04.600 --> 19:07.440
Chi, are you happy seeing me like this?

313
19:08.320 --> 19:09.720
You've never seen me so pathetic, have you?

314
19:11.160 --> 19:13.960
Missy, would you be happy if you saw me down and out?

315
19:14.560 --> 19:15.680
Maybe.

316
19:19.440 --> 19:21.840
What's really going on with you?

317
19:22.640 --> 19:23.480
-I am fine. -You wouldn't

318
19:23.560 --> 19:25.760
push yourself this hard just for work.

319
19:25.840 --> 19:27.720
Is your family giving you trouble again?

320
19:29.480 --> 19:30.560
Why put yourself through this?

321
19:30.640 --> 19:33.800
It's not like you just found out your parents favor boys over girls.

322
19:36.360 --> 19:38.240
They don't just favor boys.

323
19:39.000 --> 19:41.840
They team up to put me down and lie to me.

324
19:43.120 --> 19:45.320
You think your proposal was really that good?

325
19:45.400 --> 19:46.400
It wasn't.

326
19:47.200 --> 19:50.320
My dad had someone reach out to Mr. Zheng at Celestial

327
19:50.400 --> 19:51.520
to reject my proposal.

328
19:51.600 --> 19:53.080
That's how you got the chance.

329
19:54.240 --> 19:55.440
Why?

330
19:57.520 --> 19:59.720
They want me back at Siwei Group early,

331
19:59.800 --> 20:03.320
just to play second fiddle to their precious son Bu Tianjie.

332
20:03.920 --> 20:05.840
Xiaojie is still young.

333
20:05.920 --> 20:08.960
He won't be able to take over until he finishes his master's degree.

334
20:09.920 --> 20:12.520
And that's at least 20 years from now.

335
20:12.600 --> 20:14.520
I can't be everywhere at once.

336
20:14.600 --> 20:19.600
I need someone I can trust to watch over the business for Xiaojie.

337
20:21.560 --> 20:26.920
I wanted to get into consulting because it's the fastest way to grow.

338
20:27.680 --> 20:31.640
If I can become a partner at a top consulting firm by 35,

339
20:31.720 --> 20:34.040
no one can question my ability to be the successor.

340
20:35.000 --> 20:37.280
But they won't even give me that chance.

341
20:37.360 --> 20:39.040
They just want me to go back to the company now.

342
20:39.120 --> 20:39.960
They're gaslighting me.

343
20:40.040 --> 20:42.760
They want me to be a stepping stone for their precious son.

344
20:44.760 --> 20:46.240
Very hilarious.

345
20:46.320 --> 20:48.520
Let me show you. This is what my parents say.

346
20:49.320 --> 20:52.800
Give her a few setbacks at work,

347
20:52.880 --> 20:56.240
then shower her with warmth at home.

348
20:56.320 --> 20:58.000
With a bit of push and pull like this,

349
20:58.600 --> 21:03.200
getting her back to our company will just fall into place.

350
21:04.320 --> 21:06.800
"Start her at the very bottom of finance.

351
21:06.880 --> 21:08.280
She won't be able to pivot later anyway.

352
21:08.360 --> 21:10.720
At worst, we can trap her with a General Manager title.

353
21:10.800 --> 21:14.400
We can always have a CEO and Board Chairman above that."

354
21:15.920 --> 21:17.120
My mom is even funnier.

355
21:17.760 --> 21:19.120
My brother is this young,

356
21:19.200 --> 21:21.120
and my mom already has my dad taking my brother to observe sales.

357
21:21.200 --> 21:24.800
She says nothing matters more than sales.

358
21:25.960 --> 21:29.240
So don't try to comfort me with some flimsy words.

359
21:29.320 --> 21:30.360
You have no idea

360
21:30.440 --> 21:33.520
how painful it is to never be the one chosen from the start.

361
21:34.720 --> 21:35.920
I do.

362
21:37.160 --> 21:40.280
I know what it feels like to never be the one chosen

363
21:40.360 --> 21:41.400
from the start.

364
21:42.040 --> 21:44.680
That's why I let Ye Xinzhi go.

365
21:47.000 --> 21:48.320
Why are you so stupid?

366
21:50.080 --> 21:51.440
Where are you going?

367
21:52.320 --> 21:53.160
Don't hold me back.

368
21:53.240 --> 21:54.960
I'm going to go settle things with that scumbag.

369
21:55.040 --> 21:56.600
-You… -He works at C&C,

370
21:56.680 --> 21:58.040
-across from Maxmise, right? -What are you going to do?

371
21:58.120 --> 21:59.880
I'm going to kill him! That scumbag.

372
21:59.960 --> 22:01.280
This is a lawful society.

373
22:01.360 --> 22:03.080
Listen to me. He didn't do anything to me.

374
22:03.160 --> 22:04.600
You're so silly.

375
22:04.680 --> 22:06.720
He fooled you and you're still defending him?

376
22:06.800 --> 22:09.000
I know these polished scumbags inside and out.

377
22:09.080 --> 22:09.920
Back in college,

378
22:10.000 --> 22:11.360
two of my roommates got wrecked by guys like him.

379
22:11.440 --> 22:13.200
No initiating. No refusing. No taking responsibility.

380
22:13.280 --> 22:14.120
Sleep with you

381
22:14.200 --> 22:16.120
-and then turn cold as ice. -Stop, stop.

382
22:16.720 --> 22:18.400
Nothing happened between us.

383
22:18.480 --> 22:20.120
I just didn't want to keep

384
22:20.200 --> 22:22.920
playing that ambiguous game anymore, so I told him I had a boyfriend.

385
22:23.000 --> 22:23.960
You dumped him?

386
22:28.920 --> 22:31.560
I'm dizzy. I'm so dizzy.

387
22:31.640 --> 22:32.600
Oh my.

388
22:33.320 --> 22:34.640
Drink some more juice.

389
22:36.800 --> 22:41.720
It took me a long time to finally realize one thing.

390
22:43.120 --> 22:45.200
That I like Ye Xinzhi.

391
22:49.280 --> 22:50.760
I told you a long time ago.

392
22:50.840 --> 22:53.920
Posers like that are absolute pros at flirting.

393
22:54.000 --> 22:56.360
You fall right in before you know it. You just wouldn't listen.

394
22:56.440 --> 22:59.360
What good is me nagging you every single day?

395
22:59.440 --> 23:01.320
Come on, I'm the one venting here.

396
23:01.400 --> 23:03.600
Do you have to fire back at every single thing I say?

397
23:05.960 --> 23:08.400
Get this straight. I'm the one who feels awful right now.

398
23:08.480 --> 23:11.280
You're drinking my wine, eating my chips, and lying on my couch.

399
23:11.360 --> 23:12.680
I'm stuck on the floor.

400
23:12.760 --> 23:14.440
Is it too much to ask you to listen to me?

401
23:14.520 --> 23:15.360
Go on.

402
23:22.400 --> 23:23.960
Anyway,

403
23:25.480 --> 23:27.120
I realized I like him.

404
23:27.920 --> 23:31.720
But at my current level, I… I'm not good enough for him,

405
23:31.800 --> 23:34.440
and I can't handle my own feelings.

406
23:35.200 --> 23:40.160
He said he has feelings for me, but not romantic ones.

407
23:40.760 --> 23:46.200
I thought if I drew the line with him, I could suppress my feelings.

408
23:46.280 --> 23:50.200
And then I'd just be content as an admirer.

409
23:50.280 --> 23:55.080
But every time I see him with other women,

410
23:55.160 --> 23:59.760
I… I can't help feeling jealous and disappointed.

411
24:02.640 --> 24:03.720
What did you say?

412
24:03.800 --> 24:05.960
So he's stringing you along while flirting with other girls

413
24:06.040 --> 24:06.880
in front of you?

414
24:07.520 --> 24:09.680
Isn't that textbook scumbag behavior?

415
24:09.760 --> 24:11.360
I can't hold back anymore.

416
24:11.440 --> 24:12.920
-Where are you going? -To beat him up.

417
24:15.720 --> 24:18.360
I never knew you were such a hothead.

418
24:20.840 --> 24:22.040
Because…

419
24:24.480 --> 24:25.440
Because my parents are even worse.

420
24:26.120 --> 24:27.200
But I still love them.

421
24:27.800 --> 24:30.920
So, I just take it out on other people.

422
24:35.280 --> 24:36.280
You still have me.

423
24:41.200 --> 24:42.480
I haven't settled the score with you yet.

424
24:43.800 --> 24:46.400
Ma Ke bullied you like that a few days ago.

425
24:46.480 --> 24:47.600
Why didn't you tell me?

426
24:47.680 --> 24:50.200
You came to my place and told me…

427
24:50.280 --> 24:52.280
I'll hold nothing back from now on.

428
24:52.800 --> 24:55.960
I'll… hold… hold nothing back from now on.

429
24:56.040 --> 24:57.960
"I… I… I'm going to do this and that to you.

430
24:58.040 --> 25:00.200
I'm declaring war on you." Why do you flip-flop so much?

431
25:00.280 --> 25:02.320
-Did I say that? -You want it one way,

432
25:02.400 --> 25:03.760
but you also want me to tell you everything--

433
25:03.840 --> 25:05.520
Alright, alright. Come on.

434
25:05.600 --> 25:06.440
Cheers.

435
25:12.840 --> 25:18.480
Actually, I was pretty torn that day.

436
25:19.080 --> 25:24.720
But when I saw Ye Xinzhi looking so down, I knew he must have seen me with Yang Rui.

437
25:24.800 --> 25:27.440
So, for some crazy reason, I just said yes to Yang Rui.

438
25:27.520 --> 25:28.960
But I don't regret it at all.

439
25:29.040 --> 25:31.640
Because Yang Rui is honestly a great guy.

440
25:31.720 --> 25:34.080
And Ye Xinzhi has so many admirers.

441
25:34.160 --> 25:36.520
I want to be the one who moves on first.

442
25:36.600 --> 25:37.840
I want to find my own happiness.

443
25:37.920 --> 25:40.480
That way, he'll remember me. He'll be shocked.

444
25:40.560 --> 25:43.800
He'll realize that losing my feelings was a huge loss!

445
25:44.720 --> 25:46.160
Oh my goodness.

446
25:46.240 --> 25:48.040
Well said!

447
25:48.120 --> 25:49.000
Keep going!

448
25:49.080 --> 25:50.320
-Ouch. -Don't lose the momentum.

449
26:04.200 --> 26:05.360
Bu Tianna,

450
26:06.840 --> 26:10.400
I've actually been pretty upset these past few days.

451
26:12.200 --> 26:17.320
It's this bitter, twisting pain inside.

452
26:18.880 --> 26:20.600
It hurts so much I can't even sleep.

453
26:24.120 --> 26:26.520
So I actually sympathize with Zhao Heng.

454
26:28.400 --> 26:32.480
Because I know he likes you the way I like Ye Xinzhi.

455
26:34.360 --> 26:39.080
Maybe his reasons for getting close to you aren't entirely pure,

456
26:40.200 --> 26:42.240
but his feelings are real.

457
26:45.040 --> 26:46.320
How do you know?

458
26:50.080 --> 26:52.200
Because at our core,

459
26:53.000 --> 26:55.440
he and I are the same kind of person.

460
27:13.360 --> 27:16.080
So I actually sympathize with Zhao Heng.

461
27:16.160 --> 27:20.640
Because I know he likes you the way I like Ye Xinzhi.

462
27:21.920 --> 27:22.960
Maybe

463
27:23.560 --> 27:26.120
his reasons for getting close to you aren't entirely pure,

464
27:26.760 --> 27:28.760
but his feelings are real.

465
27:43.440 --> 27:44.360
What are you doing?

466
27:44.440 --> 27:48.080
Video calling someone out of the blue is rude.

467
27:48.160 --> 27:50.400
Wait, just hear me out. Where are you?

468
27:50.480 --> 27:51.320
Are you okay?

469
27:51.400 --> 27:52.520
Didn't Xu Chi tell you?

470
27:52.600 --> 27:53.920
Xu Chi?

471
27:54.000 --> 27:55.480
Xu Chi is with you?

472
27:56.360 --> 27:57.640
Where are you? Put her on the phone.

473
27:57.720 --> 27:58.840
She's not here.

474
27:58.920 --> 28:00.440
I'm at home. I'm fine.

475
28:00.520 --> 28:01.640
Fine?

476
28:02.680 --> 28:03.520
You're not lying to me?

477
28:03.600 --> 28:05.560
I wouldn't waste that kind of energy on you.

478
28:08.480 --> 28:09.680
That's a relief.

479
28:16.120 --> 28:17.840
Are you at a construction site?

480
28:23.360 --> 28:24.200
There's no elevator here.

481
28:24.800 --> 28:27.040
I ran all the way down from the 17th floor.

482
28:29.680 --> 28:31.760
No signal or power on the 17th floor?

483
28:31.840 --> 28:34.640
And couldn't you catch your breath before talking to me?

484
28:34.720 --> 28:37.080
You're just guilt-tripping me for sympathy.

485
28:37.160 --> 28:38.400
Still got the energy to snap at me.

486
28:39.040 --> 28:40.560
That means you're fine.

487
28:41.200 --> 28:42.600
I really didn't think that far at first.

488
28:42.680 --> 28:43.960
I just panicked.

489
28:44.040 --> 28:45.640
I figured I'd drive over to find you first.

490
28:46.400 --> 28:47.680
But I only knew which building you were in.

491
28:47.760 --> 28:48.600
I didn't know your unit number.

492
28:48.680 --> 28:51.000
Besides, even if I went, the security guard wouldn't let me in.

493
28:51.080 --> 28:52.280
I'm such an idiot.

494
29:00.760 --> 29:02.520
Hello? Why is it lagging?

495
29:03.400 --> 29:04.440
Can you hear me?

496
29:05.000 --> 29:07.040
Is my signal bad? Here.

497
29:07.120 --> 29:09.040
Let me… Let me call you back.

498
29:09.640 --> 29:11.040
I want ice cream.

499
29:12.720 --> 29:16.840
When I was little, I loved ice cream from fast food places.

500
29:17.520 --> 29:23.160
Because they had sweet ice cream and lots of kids.

501
29:23.720 --> 29:25.440
But my parents said it was junk food.

502
29:25.520 --> 29:27.640
They wouldn't let me have any.

503
29:27.720 --> 29:29.080
So after I started school,

504
29:29.160 --> 29:33.520
I went a really long time without ice cream or fries or anything.

505
29:34.120 --> 29:36.360
But the more they tried to stop me, the more I wanted to do it.

506
29:36.440 --> 29:37.600
I'm in Unit 1902.

507
30:24.920 --> 30:27.320
Hello, little Tianna.

508
30:28.000 --> 30:32.320
I'm your Uncle Buka.

509
30:32.400 --> 30:37.760
I'm here to bring you joy and happiness.

510
30:48.680 --> 30:49.760
Why are you leaving?

511
30:49.840 --> 30:51.240
What, Uncle Buka?

512
30:51.320 --> 30:53.120
What cartoon has a character that ugly?

513
30:53.200 --> 30:54.480
That's terrible!

514
31:12.400 --> 31:15.840
I didn't really watch TV much anyway.

515
31:16.360 --> 31:18.840
When I went to the shop to borrow the costume,

516
31:19.520 --> 31:22.680
they told me all the ones I knew were already taken,

517
31:22.760 --> 31:23.760
or I'd have to wait.

518
31:23.840 --> 31:26.760
But I couldn't wait a single minute.

519
31:28.080 --> 31:28.960
But that's okay.

520
31:32.240 --> 31:39.080
From now on, I'm your personal magic elf, Uncle Buka.

521
31:44.560 --> 31:46.280
You did this on purpose! You're so annoying!

522
31:46.360 --> 31:48.080
You're so sneaky. You did this on purpose.

523
31:48.160 --> 31:50.680
You're just trying to move me with this cheap little thing, right?

524
31:51.280 --> 31:52.960
You think I'd fall for that?

525
31:53.040 --> 31:55.520
Men are all the same.

526
32:03.800 --> 32:04.920
Stop hitting me.

527
32:06.120 --> 32:07.600
If you keep that up…

528
32:09.480 --> 32:12.880
Uncle Buka might turn into the Big Bad Wolf.

529
32:14.320 --> 32:15.240
You wouldn't dare.

530
32:27.920 --> 32:30.080
Alright. The magic transfer is complete.

531
32:30.160 --> 32:31.480
Time for good food.

532
33:02.640 --> 33:05.800
From now on, Uncle Buka will always be with you.

533
34:16.719 --> 34:18.520
You actually let him into your place?

534
34:20.080 --> 34:22.000
You actually tipped him off?

535
34:22.600 --> 34:25.880
He and I aren't that close. Okay?

536
34:26.480 --> 34:28.639
Well, things between him and me aren't what you think.

537
34:28.719 --> 34:30.199
Stop making up stories.

538
34:31.880 --> 34:34.199
You let him in. You hugged, and you cried.

539
34:34.280 --> 34:35.480
And I'm making things up?

540
34:38.080 --> 34:38.960
He and I are just…

541
34:41.840 --> 34:43.880
Fine. I'm all physical, no feelings.

542
34:43.960 --> 34:45.760
Who do you think I am? I am Bu Tianna.

543
34:45.840 --> 34:46.679
Get it straight.

544
34:46.760 --> 34:49.280
You're a total cold-hearted player.

545
34:51.280 --> 34:53.400
Aren't you afraid of falling for it one day?

546
34:55.280 --> 34:56.199
Well…

547
34:56.280 --> 34:57.840
Right back at you. You're no different.

548
34:57.920 --> 34:58.760
Let me tell you,

549
34:58.840 --> 35:00.800
even though the project team used your proposal,

550
35:00.880 --> 35:02.520
you didn't really beat me.

551
35:08.120 --> 35:09.880
Then I'll just wish you good health.

552
35:09.960 --> 35:12.040
And I'll wish you all the happiness in love.

553
35:17.240 --> 35:18.400
A face-to-face showdown?

554
35:18.480 --> 35:20.120
Classic top-tier consultants.

555
35:20.200 --> 35:21.080
Impressive.

556
35:21.160 --> 35:22.160
Don't get the wrong idea.

557
35:22.240 --> 35:24.080
Our team's fights are always quite civilized.

558
35:24.160 --> 35:25.760
Never this explosive.

559
35:27.720 --> 35:29.960
I'm just kidding. Don't take it seriously.

560
35:37.240 --> 35:40.040
When we talk to them later, listen more and talk less.

561
35:44.000 --> 35:45.680
Miss Xu, your package.

562
35:45.760 --> 35:47.240
Your colleague asked me to bring it over.

563
35:47.320 --> 35:48.200
Thanks.

564
35:49.280 --> 35:50.320
Package?

565
36:11.560 --> 36:13.680
Came across this old postcard by chance.

566
36:13.760 --> 36:16.120
Returning the best times to you.

567
36:16.800 --> 36:17.640
From Ye Xinzhi.

568
36:19.720 --> 36:20.760
What's wrong?

569
36:24.920 --> 36:26.040
Sorry I'm late.

570
36:26.120 --> 36:27.040
Mr. Sun.

571
36:29.200 --> 36:30.120
-Hello. -Hello.

572
36:30.200 --> 36:32.200
After getting the full lay of the land, Maxmise's preliminary recommendation

573
36:32.280 --> 36:34.680
is to work out a microservices architecture plan.

574
36:34.760 --> 36:35.600
Hold on.

575
36:35.680 --> 36:36.840
FRONTEND AND BACKEND ADMIN PANEL

576
36:36.920 --> 36:38.600
A microservices architecture plan?

577
36:40.520 --> 36:42.440
I told you we already have SOA.

578
36:43.720 --> 36:44.800
Please take a closer look.

579
36:45.400 --> 36:48.560
We modeled this after Ansheng, the biggest insurer in the Netherlands.

580
36:48.640 --> 36:49.560
Compared to SOA,

581
36:49.640 --> 36:51.720
it's better suited for Celestial's future development.

582
36:51.800 --> 36:53.600
So everything I just said was for nothing?

583
36:53.680 --> 36:56.400
Or was I speaking a foreign language that you can't even understand?

584
36:57.720 --> 36:58.720
Fine. Let me ask you.

585
36:58.800 --> 37:00.280
What makes microservices better than SOA?

586
37:04.120 --> 37:06.920
Microservices are essentially a more decentralized version of SOA.

587
37:07.600 --> 37:09.400
Mr. Sun, you're absolutely right.

588
37:09.480 --> 37:11.760
But based on Maxmise's assessment,

589
37:11.840 --> 37:12.760
a more flexible microservices approach

590
37:12.840 --> 37:14.880
would better support Celestial's future growth.

591
37:14.960 --> 37:16.440
This transformation has to happen,

592
37:16.520 --> 37:19.280
so please make sure to fully cooperate with us on the redevelopment.

593
37:19.360 --> 37:20.440
And this also needs

594
37:20.520 --> 37:22.920
to be included in the delivery report with an implementation timeline.

595
37:23.000 --> 37:27.000
So, Mr. Sun, how about three months? Four?

596
37:27.880 --> 37:30.920
Wait, Mr. Sun, that's not what our team lead meant.

597
37:31.480 --> 37:34.040
Microservices are lightweight and compact, commonly used by internet companies.

598
37:34.120 --> 37:35.840
SOA is an enterprise-level, large-scale architecture.

599
37:35.920 --> 37:37.960
That's basic knowledge. Anyone in IT knows that.

600
37:38.040 --> 37:39.160
You mentioned the Netherlands earlier.

601
37:39.240 --> 37:41.040
So tell me, how many people does the entire Netherlands have?

602
37:41.120 --> 37:43.320
Of course, their insurance companies can use microservices.

603
37:43.400 --> 37:44.840
We have hundreds of millions of customers!

604
37:45.440 --> 37:46.440
Our SOA works perfectly fine,

605
37:46.520 --> 37:48.040
and you want us to just switch to microservices?

606
37:48.120 --> 37:49.480
And get it done in three months?

607
37:49.560 --> 37:50.760
Do you have any idea how much work that is?

608
37:51.360 --> 37:52.840
You might as well tell me to fly to the moon!

609
37:52.920 --> 37:53.800
Wait, Mr. Sun.

610
37:55.280 --> 37:57.640
Mr. Sun. Please don't be upset.

611
37:57.720 --> 37:58.560
-Mr. Sun. -We can…

612
37:58.640 --> 38:00.360
We can discuss the specifics.

613
38:00.880 --> 38:01.960
Miss Xu,

614
38:02.040 --> 38:03.640
I was there the day you presented your proposal.

615
38:03.720 --> 38:05.280
Honestly, I was moved.

616
38:05.360 --> 38:06.880
I thought you were someone who gets things done.

617
38:07.480 --> 38:10.320
But after today's conversation, a saying comes to mind.

618
38:10.840 --> 38:14.240
"I thought you were impressive, until you started talking about my field."

619
38:15.640 --> 38:18.440
Oh, and please don't come to the IT Department anymore.

620
38:18.520 --> 38:19.760
It saves everyone's time.

621
38:34.080 --> 38:35.240
Xu Chi.

622
38:35.840 --> 38:36.840
Xu Chi!

623
38:39.840 --> 38:40.920
Xu Chi.

624
38:41.520 --> 38:42.720
Maybe it's your first time seeing someone blow a fuse,

625
38:42.800 --> 38:43.720
so you can't handle it,

626
38:43.800 --> 38:45.080
but this kind of thing happens all the time.

627
38:45.160 --> 38:46.440
How could you make the decision

628
38:46.520 --> 38:48.720
to replace the entire SOA without discussing it with me?

629
38:51.040 --> 38:52.080
I'm the team lead.

630
38:52.160 --> 38:53.680
The plan is mine to decide.

631
38:53.760 --> 38:55.040
And using precedent cases from the reference library

632
38:55.120 --> 38:56.600
is standard Maxmise practice.

633
38:58.240 --> 38:59.760
I'm not questioning you.

634
38:59.840 --> 39:03.040
I just think if we'd discussed it first, Mr. Sun wouldn't have pushed back so hard.

635
39:05.440 --> 39:06.600
This time we just got unlucky.

636
39:06.680 --> 39:07.880
This is the first time I've run into someone like that.

637
39:08.480 --> 39:09.400
Maxmise isn't magic.

638
39:09.480 --> 39:11.560
How could we possibly know every company's technical details?

639
39:11.640 --> 39:13.520
Just showing them a tiny bit is more than enough.

640
39:23.720 --> 39:26.040
You mentioned SOA earlier.

641
39:26.120 --> 39:27.360
You actually know about that stuff.

642
39:27.440 --> 39:29.000
I think we should revise the plan.

643
39:29.080 --> 39:31.800
At least don't make Celestial replace their entire service architecture.

644
39:31.880 --> 39:34.360
No. You need to listen to me on this.

645
39:34.440 --> 39:35.600
The plan is solid.

646
39:35.680 --> 39:37.200
Mr. Sun just isn't ready to accept it yet.

647
39:37.280 --> 39:39.400
Give him the cold shoulder for a few days, and he'll come around.

648
39:39.480 --> 39:41.200
We've always done it this way.

649
39:42.360 --> 39:44.360
But that's not how you solve--

650
39:50.760 --> 39:51.920
Hello, Ma Ke.

651
39:52.000 --> 39:53.960
Yes. Yes.

652
39:54.040 --> 39:56.600
I don't know why Mr. Sun blew up like that.

653
39:56.680 --> 39:58.920
Don't worry. I'll convince him.

654
40:01.640 --> 40:02.480
Xu Chi…

655
40:03.240 --> 40:04.120
Alright. Okay.

656
40:04.720 --> 40:05.720
I'll tell her.

657
40:12.920 --> 40:14.240
Ma Ke said

658
40:14.840 --> 40:17.560
Mr. Sun has been flat-out refusing to change the IT architecture

659
40:17.640 --> 40:19.080
and has such a strong reaction to you,

660
40:19.160 --> 40:20.440
so there's definitely more to this story.

661
40:20.520 --> 40:23.640
He said he'll look into it, and we should put this on hold.

662
40:24.640 --> 40:25.640
Put it on hold?

663
40:26.200 --> 40:27.880
What does that mean? Is work on pause?

664
40:27.960 --> 40:29.000
What am I supposed to do then?

665
40:30.160 --> 40:32.680
How about you organize the requirements for the sales-side app?

666
40:33.480 --> 40:34.320
That's simple.

667
40:34.400 --> 40:36.040
I'll gather feedback

668
40:36.120 --> 40:37.680
on the IT Department from other departments.

669
40:37.760 --> 40:39.800
As for Mr. Sun…

670
40:41.360 --> 40:44.720
I'll figure out a way to put some pressure on him.
